{"text": "To target 24 using the numbers 4, 6, 13, and 13 with each number used exactly once and only using the operations +, -, *, /, we can achieve this with the expression:", "start": 0, "end": 165, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(13 - 6) × (13 - 4)", "start": 167, "end": 186, "label": "inform"}
